      "problem": "$7$ is **not** a composite number, and $8$ is **not** a prime number.\n\nExpress the compound statement above in symbolic form given the following:\n\n- $P:7\\text{ is a composite number}$\n\n- $Q:8\\text{ is a prime number}$",
